  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Elaboration of a detailed project plan for the continued work within the Audit Accounting-project in Estonia. Continued support to Action Learning Partners ALP, to deepen their prereview. The aim of the mensioned project is to introduce a computerbased accounting system in the Estonian state administration (44/99)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppr&#xE4;ttande av en detaljerad projektplan f&#xF6;r det fortsatta arbetet inom ramen f&#xF6;r riksredovisningsprojektet i Estland. Ytterligare medel till Action Learning Partners (ALP) till f&#xF6;rdjupning av den utf&#xF6;rda f&#xF6;rstudien. Ovan n&#xE4;mnda proj. syftar till att introducera ett databaserat redovisn.syst. i den estl&#xE4;ndka statsf&#xF6;rvaltningen (44/99)</narrative>
  </description>
